OL,3,GNEWSAMother excited for son's first
OL,4,AChristmas at home
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It's been weird getting used to not
OL,7,Fhaving people around us constantly,"
OL,8,Fsays Becca Smith.
OL,10,FHer son Arlo has a rare genetic
OL,11,Fneurological condition called
OL,12,Fhyperekplexia, a disease that means he
OL,13,Fhe has muscle stiffness and sometimes
OL,14,Fcannot breathe.
OL,16,FIn two-and-a-half years, he and his mum
OL,17,Fhave spent just six weeks at home, with
OL,18,Fspecialist treatment required to help
OL,19,Fhim deal with the condition.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
